---
title: Pigpen cipher
tags: misc
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{%- set letters = "a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m,n,o,p,q,r,s,t,u,v,w,x,y,z".split(",") -%}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    The Pigpen cipher is a simple substitution cipher where each letter is represented by a symbol formed from parts of a grid. These symbols use straight or angled lines, and may include a dot to distinguish characters.
</p>
<p class="px-2">
     There is more information available on the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pigpen_cipher" class="text-convrtr">Pigpen cipher</a> Wikipedia page. 
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
<div class="col">
    <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label visually-hidden" data-pagefind-ignore="all">Pigpen cipher</span>
        <div class="card-body text-center" data-pagefind-ignore="all">
            <div class="mb-2">
            {%- for letter in letters %}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-convrtr p-0 mb-1 border border-3 border-convrtr rounded-circle pig-glyph" id="pig-{{ letter | upper }}" aria-label="Glyph: {{ letter | upper }}" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="Glyph: {{ letter | upper }}">{{ letter | upper }}</button>
            {%- endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer py-3">
            <div class="text-center mb-4 g-0">
                <div class="row row-cols-2 g-sm-0 gx-0 gy-2">
                    <div class="col col-12 col-sm-auto flex-fill">
                        <div class="row row-cols-auto g-1">
                            <div class="input-group w-auto">
                                <button role="button" class="btn btn-md btn-convrtr" id="generatePigpenImage" title="Create an image from Pigpen glyphs">Create image</button>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-switch mx-2">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="pigImageTransparency" aria-checked="false" aria-labelledby="pigImageTransparencyLabel">
                                <label class="form-check-label" id="pigImageTransparencyLabel" for="pigImageTransparency">Transparent background <span class="visually-hidden">for Pigpen image</span></label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-auto">
                        <div class="row row-cols-auto g-0">
                            <div class="col d-flex flex-fill justify-content-end">
                                {% include "components/select-copy-dl.njk" %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <hr />
            <div id="{{ filename }}Results" class="data-to-copy active convrtr-results h5"></div>
            <div id="{{ filename }}ImageResults" class="pigpen convrtr-results"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{% endcall %}
